    "lyrics": [
        {
            "section_id": "section_0",
            "type": "kool",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Tashan (Junkadelic)",
                    "rhyme": "an",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I move in the area, for respect, Tashan Dorrsett",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Draft pick by Seton Hall",
                    "rhyme": "ol",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Escaped convict out of Marquette, sonic I'm Stet",
                    "rhyme": "E",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "First man, to fly to the moon on a private jet",
                    "rhyme": "Et",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Rocketship Express",
                    "rhyme": "Es",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Exhaust pipes burn the hair off your chest",
                    "rhyme": "Est",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Brim over my head, cocked to the side like El. Ness",
                    "rhyme": "Es",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Chicago chronicle, move with Elvis",
                    "rhyme": "is",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "With Jaycee and Will, I'm bound to get ill",
                    "rhyme": "il",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "Hit the P-day Parade, my daily brigade",
                    "rhyme": "ad",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "Cooler than that glass nigga dressed up like a jar of Kool-Aid",
                    "rhyme": "Ed",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "12",
                    "text": "I'm too fade",
                    "rhyme": "ad",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "13",
                    "text": "I'm cuttin your fame down to miniature size with two blades",
                    "rhyme": "ad",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "14",
                    "text": "I'm not out for fun, we don't have time to stargaze",
                    "rhyme": "az",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "15",
                    "text": "Me and Ollie light up the street like Dr. Spocky",
                    "rhyme": "i",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "16",
                    "text": "Girls hang on the jockey",
                    "rhyme": "E",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "17",
                    "text": "It's all c'est la vie, well c'est la C",
                    "rhyme": "s",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "18",
                    "text": "Two minutes to go",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "It's the international connection",
                    "rhyme": "$",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "We makin hip-hop perfection",
                    "rhyme": "$",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "It's Ultramag and Junkadelic dawg",
                    "rhyme": "iN",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "We about to teach the whole world a lesson",
                    "rhyme": "$",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "About how to rap, how to make beats",
                    "rhyme": "a",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "How to walk, and how to even speak",
                    "rhyme": "Ek",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "And if you learned your lesson right",
                    "rhyme": "ajt",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "You'd be at the top of this game",
                    "rhyme": "Ejm",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "You'd get all the shine you want, you'd get fame",
                    "rhyme": "am",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "ced",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Oh yeah son, I guess it's time for Ced to go",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "So let me hear this track, oh yeah dawg, I like that flow",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "So I'm about to bless you with 16, just like a pro",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "You know how I gets down, I keeps it real simple",
                    "rhyme": ")pl",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "The swagger's incredible; son I always smash my foes",
                    "rhyme": "is",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Son, I'm always, smashin hoes",
                    "rhyme": "is",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Son, I'm always, collectin dough",
                    "rhyme": "O",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "So if you see me up in Harlem, don't even think about it",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Cause me and my faction squad son, we bout it bout it",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "We take care of our business; beef, we don't forget about it",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "We squash your whole team, your whole squad get routed",
                    "rhyme": "e",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "It's like that in my hood dawg, don't even doubt it",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_4",
            "type": "d.eazy",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I'm tryin to be in the streets, see the Marlboro",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "You don't understand you gotta live with the borough",
                    "rhyme": "O",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Stand still nigga wanna act like he thorough",
                    "rhyme": "O",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Missed his vertabrae when I sprayed ten times",
                    "rhyme": "im",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "And buckin, niggas askin questions like they still duckin",
                    "rhyme": "in",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "The bug is filled with brains and cranium cracked",
                    "rhyme": "e",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Never did give a fuck if the stadium cracked",
                    "rhyme": "e",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "I understand that's how you feel whenever you get jacked",
                    "rhyme": "e",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "But we still on the track, Ultra, Magnetic",
                    "rhyme": "ik",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "Niggas is askin questions but I'm just so pragmatic",
                    "rhyme": "ik",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "Mathematic, sometimes I gotta come back on the beat",
                    "rhyme": "it",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "12",
                    "text": "With two times five divided by pi you see",
                    "rhyme": "i",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "13",
                    "text": "It's like this, inside of your eyes you open",
                    "rhyme": "@n",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "14",
                    "text": "Niggas talk shit but the beam's still open",
                    "rhyme": "@n",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_6",
            "type": "outro",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Yeah yeah yeah~! (Junkadelic)",
                    "rhyme": "E",
